{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11202180","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11202180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1120218001:1":{"text":"…오우거의 장례식, 나도 참석할게.","source_cn":"……奥格的葬礼，我会参加的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F462834C7896168","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120218002:1":{"text":"소렌, 정말이야? 싫으면 참석하지 안아도 돼.","source_cn":"索恩，你确定吗？如果你不想去的话，其实也没关系的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D06532ED723F03B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1120218002":{"text":"소렌, 정말이야? 싫으면 참석하지 안아도 돼.","source_cn":"索恩，你确定吗？如果你不想去的话，其实也没关系的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D06532ED723F03B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120218003:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 괜찮아. 참석하기로 결정했어.","source_cn":"没关系，<style=stress><player_n...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA335FBBB26D05C4D","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 괜찮아. 참석하기로 결정했어.","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>, 괜찮아. 참석하기로 결정했어.","variant_male_record_index":"118351","variant_female_record_index":"118352","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120218004:1":{"text":"축하하네, 소렌. 과거를 직시할 수 있는 사람은 앞으로 나아갈 용기를 갖게 되는 법이지.","source_cn":"恭喜你，索恩。能够正视过去的人，一定也拥有向前迈进的勇气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53633BAC1B13326D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120218005:1":{"text":"브루투스 님… 고맙습니다.","source_cn":"布鲁特斯大人……谢谢您。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x530309E57BAED00A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120218006:1":{"text":"소렌, 넌 당연히 아버지의 장례식에 참석해야 한다. 그리고 블랙하울의 규칙에 따라 장례식에서 우리는…","source_cn":"你当然应该出席父亲的葬礼。索恩，我希望你还记得黑嚎的规...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE8EF3670142B01DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120218007:1":{"text":"난 블랙하울의 규칙이 뭔지 몰라! 알기도 전에 이미 버려졌으니까.","source_cn":"我可不知道什么黑嚎的规矩。你忘了吗？在我还没记事的时候...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6D86A857C8EAE55","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120218008:1":{"text":"그럼 지금이라도 알려주지. 아들로서 우리는 아버지의 장례식에 부장품을 준비해야 해.","source_cn":"那我现在告诉你，身为子嗣，我们需要在父亲的葬礼上献上陪...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACFCC38790E2DE11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120218009:1":{"text":"큭, 아버지? 아무렇지 않은 듯 그 단어를 꺼내는 군.","source_cn":"呵，“父亲”……你还真是能轻飘飘地说出这个词啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DDA37A52F2F0232","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120218010:1":{"text":"하긴 넌 그 아버지란 자의 곁에서 자랐으니까 그렇겠지.","source_cn":"是因为这么多年来，你都乖乖地待在“父亲”身边吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2899C8FC3794601E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120218011:1":{"text":"하지만 쿠긴, 난 아니야. 오우거는 내 아버지가 아니라고! 명심해!","source_cn":"库金，我和你不一样。我不会承认奥格是我的父亲。在他活着...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD458A49DC901FBF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120218012:1":{"text":"어떻게 그런 말을 할 수 있지?! 너와 난 다 아버지의 아들이야! 그리고 이 사실은 영원히 변하지 않아!","source_cn":"你怎么能说出这种话！你和我一样，是父亲的儿子。唯有这一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECA35645A1565BC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1120218013:1":{"text":"그럼 그 아버지라는 작자가 사막에 날 버릴 때, 내가 본인의 아들이란 생각은 했을까?","source_cn":"将我亲手抛弃在沙漠上的时候，他有想过自己是一个“父亲”吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BC50AB86FDB1F40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120218014:1":{"text":"네가 인정하든 안 하든 네 몸속에는 아버지의 피가… 블랙하울의 피가 흐르고 있다는 건 사실이야!","source_cn":"不管你是否承认，你身上都流淌着父亲的血脉……黑嚎的血脉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB81D7FC6E7CEE976","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1120218015:1":{"text":"날 설득하려 하지 마. 그럴 수도 없겠지만.","source_cn":"你不用试图说服我，也不可能说服我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x884654A98472978C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120218016:1":{"text":"…부장품은 초코보의 깃털, 야생 늑대의 이빨, 쿰초를 엮어 명복의 목걸이를 만들어야 해. ","source_cn":"……陪葬之物需要陆行鸟的羽毛，野狼的牙，和库姆草揉成的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE1C42DAF944F9DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120218017:1":{"text":"블랙하울의 전사들을 석양의 신의 품에 안길 수 있도록 인도하고 보호해 주는 물건이지.","source_cn":"它可以指引和护佑黑嚎的战士们，走向残阳神的怀抱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0731827B64937DE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120218018:1":{"text":"할지 말지는 너 스스로가 결정해라.","source_cn":"至于你要不要去做，你自己决定。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9764CF66ABC7F60A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"네가 원하면 우리도 참석 안 할게","source_cn":"我们可以陪你一起离开","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1C7881AFDD21483A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 원하면 우리도 참석 안 할게","fem